	•	Algorithm Name: Adaboost, Logistic Regression, Decision Tree, Support Vector Machine, and K-nearest neighbor
	•	Input Variables (Data Modality): Tabular (EMR); Donor metrics
	•	Comparator / Standard of Care: Linear Risk Score
