	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: This was a retrospective UNOS analysis using “solely pre-transplant variables.” The dataset was split 3:1 into derivation and validation cohorts. Five supervised ML algorithms were trained after automated feature selection with “SVM-FuzCoC.” Hyperparameter optimization was explicitly performed, and LIME was used to explain the best-performing model. The IMPACT score served as a comparator for 1-year survival.  ￼

Section 4: AI Quality & Reproducibility (CONVINCE Standards)
	•	Missing Data Handling: Complete Case Analysis
	•	Class Imbalance Addressed: Yes
	•	Code Availability: No
