	•	Training Size (N): 13969
	•	Test Size (N): 4656
	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: The authors excluded variables with “>10% missing values,” which is best classified here as complete-case style handling at the variable level rather than imputation. Class imbalance was addressed by “random oversampling.” Preprocessing was described, including exclusion criteria and conversion of categorical/textual variables to numerical format. Figure 1 reports training n = 13,969 and validation n = 4,656. No code release statement was identified.  ￼

